%% PakVoice AI — High-level algorithm flow (generation / RAG / images)
flowchart TD
  Start([User Action]) --> Choice{Feature}

  Choice -->|Generate Content| G1[Collect form inputs]
  G1 --> G2{RAG enabled?}
  G2 -->|Yes| G3[Embed query]
  G3 --> G4[Chroma top-k retrieve]
  G4 --> G5[Augment prompt with chunks]
  G2 -->|No| G5b[Build prompt without KB]
  G5 --> G6[Call OpenAI chat model]
  G5b --> G6
  G6 --> G7[Stream / return text]
  G7 --> G8[Persist history.json]
  G8 --> Done([Done])

  Choice -->|Upload Document| U1[Validate file type/size]
  U1 --> U2[Parse PDF/DOCX/TXT/MD]
  U2 --> U3[Clean + chunk text]
  U3 --> U4[Embed chunks]
  U4 --> U5[Store vectors in Chroma]
  U5 --> U6[Save metadata documents.json]
  U6 --> Done

  Choice -->|Generate Image| I1[Receive content + image_type]
  I1 --> I2[Extract brand details via LLM]
  I2 --> I3[Build image / poster prompt]
  I3 --> I4[Call OpenAI image model<br/>and/or Jinja+Playwright render]
  I4 --> I5[Store file under generated_images/]
  I5 --> I6[Optional save to images.json gallery]
  I6 --> Done
